/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  new_components_estimated -- the 33 components DEV.md 4c C292 and
  C293 (slice 2 of C287) added to the catalogue, loaded and exercised.  Written
  by bin/curate/c287_new_components.py's companion script beside the records.

  These compounds have NO measured critical constants in the ThermoML archive:
  Tc and Pc (and Tb, where the archive reports none) are ESTIMATED by Joback
  and marked so, which this case reproduces, and omega is taken from the
  fitted vapour pressure at Tr = 0.7 of that ESTIMATED Tc.

  1. REPRODUCTION.  One `estimateComponent` per component with the Joback
     groups its record declares (groups.joback): the run prints Tb, Tc, Pc,
     the ideal-gas Cp, dHf_298 and dGf_298 the record carries as ESTIMATES
     (s_298 = (dHf - dGf)/298.15 + the elements' CODATA standard entropies).
  2. SMOKE TEST.  One `propertyScan1D` per component, 300-340 K at 1 bar:
     the vapour pressure (the Antoine its vp case promoted), the liquid
     heat capacity and the liquid density.  Every value must evaluate;
     outside a fitted range the engine announces the extrapolation, and
     every autoPromoted value is voiced on the console and in the caveat
     block.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

